Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.45,0:00:50.13,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}囚禁我毫无意义 放我自由
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.38,0:00:52.91,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}我不必无用的担心 baby
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.96,0:00:54.71,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}我正在燃烧 yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.75,0:00:57.47,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}转生在这个舞台
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.70,0:00:59.82,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}我们今夜定会横穿这城市
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:01.19,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}让我们开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.34,0:01:03.65,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}沐浴烈焰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.54,0:01:18.32,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}谁也不能改写我的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.37,0:01:19.97,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}一路都是独自一人生存
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.13,0:01:21.98,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}外面是风暴席卷电闪雷鸣
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.98,0:01:23.48,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}钟声响起 Ding Ding Dong
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.57,0:01:24.39,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}就像金刚
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.69,0:01:27.71,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}最难的十大任务 正好让我扬名立万统领天下
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.91,0:01:31.28,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}我停不下来 怪物转生 从零转生 豪赌一把
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.53,0:01:33.22,OPCN,,0,0,0,,{\blur8\bord2\fad(50,100)}每次下注我都倾家荡产
